sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: What happens when Claude asks a question
  accDescr: Claude sends a request to Mcp4Lms. Mcp4Lms decrypts your token in memory, makes one read-only request to your LMS, returns the course data to Claude and discards the token. Claude never receives the token.
  participant C as Claude
  participant M as Mcp4Lms
  participant L as Your LMS
  C->>M: "What's due this week?"
  Note over M: Token decrypted<br/>in memory
  M->>L: One read-only request
  L-->>M: Course data
  M-->>C: Course data (never the token)
  Note over M: Token discarded
